### Scratch requests for the JetBrains/VS Code HTTP client.
### Get a token first:  bun run --cwd backend dev:token
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = paste-a-dev-token-here

### Liveness (no auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Readiness (no auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ready

### Metrics (no auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics

### List users
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search and filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?q=admin&role=admin&status=active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a user
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "new@example.com",
  "name": "New User",
  "role": "member"
}

### Get one
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update (absent keys are left untouched, never cleared)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Renamed"
}

### Soft delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
